  "question": {
    "text": "In the shown arrangement of the experiment of the meter bridge if $A C$ corresponding to null deflection of galvanometer is $\\mathrm{x},$ what would be its value if the radius of the wire $\\mathrm{AB}$ is doubled?\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/6MTrwJR0Q9U6cIcG-3yKIabRfQqq2XD5LiPnycjw120.original.fullsize.png\">",
